      <title>Astro Contrast Enhancer v0.9.547</title>

      <description>
        <p>Astro Contrast Enhancer provides protected Texture, Clarity, Dehaze, and lasso-based local contrast control for stretched astrophotography images.</p>
        <p>This release installs into src/scripts/CosgrovesCosmos/AstroContrastEnhancer/, uses the same Cosgrove's Cosmos menu metadata form as Astro Color Mixer, and includes a 24 px script icon resource.</p>
      </description>

    </package>

